        rdfs:comment "The graph to wrap. May also be a Dataset/ConjunctiveGraph: triples are read via its own ``.triples((None, None, None))``, which - like iterating the dataset directly - honors whatever ``default_union`` it was constructed with (rdflib default: False), so only its default graph is copied unless the caller explicitly opted into a unioned view. Named graphs are never selected implicitly; use ``dataset.get_context(identifier)`` first for a specific one." ;
