        a ns2:Function ;
        rdfs:comment """``STRDT("a", 1)`` built a literal with datatype ``<1>``. STRDT takes a
simple literal / ``xsd:string`` and an IRI (SPARQL 1.1 17.4.2.8); any
other argument is a type error.""" ;
