    ns85:_has_property_shape_inside_property_shape dcterms:identifier "starlayer.shacl.validator._has_property_shape_inside_property_shape" ;
        a ns2:Function ;
        rdfs:comment """Whether some property shape of the where-shape closure has its own ``sh:property``.

The nested property shape is evaluated with the VALUE nodes of the outer one as focus nodes, so its failures are reported on
those value nodes and not on the candidate that has them. One batched report then cannot say which candidate failed (it
would blame the value node and clear the candidate), so such a where-shape is decided one candidate at a time.""" ;
        rdfs:label "_has_property_shape_inside_property_shape" ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/starlayer/shacl/validator.py" ;
